OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARopemaker says Traitors response
OL,4,A'fantastic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Outram, who said he is one of about
OL,7,F15 traditional ropemakers left in
OL,8,FEngland, admitted he had not watched
OL,9,Fthe show but was pleased to have his
OL,10,F"at-risk heritage craft" on TV.
